╭─ ⚕ Hermes ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
    Fixed the autorun=1 timing race in /home/kyle/projects/rogue-pachinko/tests/index.html:
    
    1. runAll() — moved the load listener setup BEFORE the iframe navigation fires (line 301-307). The loadPromise is created first, then iframe.srcdoc or iframe.src is assigned, then await loadPromise. This eliminates the race where a fast local server could fire the load event before the listener was attached.
    
    2. autorun trigger — changed runAll() to setTimeout(runAll, 0) (line 394). This defers by one tick so the DOM is fully ready before the test run kicks off.
    
    Both gsCheck/GS-undefined handlers were preserved unchanged.
